# Agent command auto-allow (parkinglot)

The user configured `~/.cursor/permissions.json` and `.cursor/permissions.json` so routine work should not require clicking **Allow**.

When running API tests or lint:

- Prefer `make run-api-tests` from the repo root (allowlisted via `make`). Fallback: `bash scripts/run-api-tests.sh` — not `./scripts/...` (often blocked by prefix rules).
- Use read-only git (`git status`, `git diff`, `git log`) freely.
- Do not ask the user to run terminal commands manually when you can run them yourself.

If Run Mode in Cursor is still set to ask every time, remind them once: **Cursor Settings → Agents → Run Mode → Auto-review** (see `.cursor/AGENT-AUTO-ALLOW.md`).
